                          "fill": "$text2",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Two navigation surfaces competed for the same screen edge. Below 768px the file tree collapsed into the hamburger drawer, leaving the content column with nothing to render until a file was already selected.",
